<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Your custom CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
    
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>

<h1 class="text-center mb-5">My Projects</h1>

<div class="row">

    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-dark text-light border-secondary">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="card-title">Networking and Network Configuration</h2>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Through my networking coursework, I have worked on projects
                    involving IP addressing, subnetting, and network configuration.
                    These projects have helped me develop a stronger understanding
                    of how computer networks communicate and operate.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-dark text-light border-secondary">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="card-title">Computer Security</h2>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Through my IT Security studies, I am developing my knowledge
                    of cybersecurity, network protection, and common security threats.
                    I continue to build my understanding of how technology can be
                    protected from potential risks and attacks.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-dark text-light border-secondary">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="card-title">Future Projects</h2>
                <p class="card-text">
                    As I continue my studies, I plan to build more projects related
                    to networking, cloud computing, and cybersecurity. I am also
                    working toward expanding my cloud knowledge through the
                    Microsoft Azure Fundamentals (AZ-900) certification.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    </div>
</body>
